                            : "模型服务暂时不可用或响应超时，请检查模型配置后重试")); }
                    catch (IOException ignored) {}
                    emitter.complete();
                }
            } finally { activeSessions.remove(prepared.sessionId(), generation); }
        }));
        if (cancelled.get()) task.get().cancel(true);
        return emitter;
    }

